{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-just-chat#card-zh","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-just-chat","commit":"906ac8faec71bcf6ff1b974a368e6b2798232012","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-just-chat 是面向 DSH Web 的快速对话插件，在首页标准模式旁和侧栏提供入口。点击后，它根据本地化名称与时间模板准备独立工作区，并通过 DSH 原生工作区接口打开新会话；同名工作区会复用。设置页可分别控制两个入口并编辑、预览和保存名称模板。它适合希望跳过手动选择工作区、快速开始独立会话的 DSH 用户；需要兼容版本范围内的 DSH Web 环境，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:109-135","client.js:328-402","index.js:39-80"]}
{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-just-chat#card-en","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-just-chat","commit":"906ac8faec71bcf6ff1b974a368e6b2798232012","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-just-chat adds quick chat buttons beside Standard mode and in the DSH web sidebar. A click prepares or reuses a workspace named from a localized label and time template, then opens a native DSH session. Settings control both buttons and the template. It needs compatible DSH web and no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:109-135","client.js:328-402","index.js:39-80"]}
